    "title": "Opinion: Vote No on Measure A-it's time to tighten our belt - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rishi Kumar ,\n1 hours ago This November, Santa Clara County voters will decide on Measure A—a countywide 5/8 sales tax hike beginning April 2026. It would raise the base rate from 9.125%, with even higher rates in San José, Milpitas and Campbell. A regressive sales tax hits struggling families hardest while doing little... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
